'''Pysk fish (0)''' is a [[food]] item made by using [[raw pysk fish (0)]] on a [[fire]] within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Eating a pysk fish heals the player for 5 [[Hitpoints]].

Cooking pysk fish requires a [[Cooking]] level of 1, and yields 10 Cooking [[experience]] for each successfully cooked fish.

